  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "题目越难，分越高？这是毕设选题里最大的坑。",
      "audio": "s01.wav",
      "raw_dur": 3.88,
      "speech_start": 0.04,
      "speech_end": 3.49,
      "dur_sec": 3.45,
      "cps": 6.09,
      "start_sec": 0.0,
      "end_sec": 3.45,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 104
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "每年都有大四同学栽在选题上：做到一半才发现做不下去，熬夜爆肝还得换题。",
      "audio": "s02.wav",
      "raw_dur": 5.38,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 4.97,
      "dur_sec": 4.97,
      "cps": 7.04,
      "start_sec": 3.53,
      "end_sec": 8.5,
      "start_frame": 106,
      "end_frame": 255
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "毕设能不能上岸，七分靠选题，三分靠制作。",
      "audio": "s03.wav",
      "raw_dur": 4.06,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 3.67,
      "dur_sec": 3.67,
      "cps": 5.45,
      "start_sec": 8.58,
      "end_sec": 12.25,
      "start_frame": 257,
      "end_frame": 368
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "先说三个最容易犯的错。",
      "audio": "s04.wav",
      "raw_dur": 1.74,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 1.33,
      "dur_sec": 1.33,
      "cps": 8.27,
      "start_sec": 12.33,
      "end_sec": 13.66,
      "start_frame": 370,
      "end_frame": 410
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "一，迷信难度。老师打分看的是完成度和工作量匹配。",
      "audio": "s05.wav",
      "raw_dur": 4.34,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 3.91,
      "dur_sec": 3.91,
      "cps": 6.14,
      "start_sec": 13.74,
      "end_sec": 17.65,
      "start_frame": 412,
      "end_frame": 530
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "高级题驾驭不住，做到中期就是半成品；完整落地的中等题，反而更容易拿高分。",
      "audio": "s06.wav",
      "raw_dur": 6.3,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 5.87,
      "dur_sec": 5.87,
      "cps": 6.13,
      "start_sec": 17.73,
      "end_sec": 23.6,
      "start_frame": 532,
      "end_frame": 708
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "二，跟风AI。没基础硬上深度学习，模型调不通，数据集不会处理，中期骑虎难下。",
      "audio": "s07.wav",
      "raw_dur": 7.52,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 7.13,
      "dur_sec": 7.13,
      "cps": 5.33,
      "start_sec": 23.68,
      "end_sec": 30.81,
      "start_frame": 710,
      "end_frame": 924
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "三，题目太空。基于某某的研究，没有具体场景，开题直接被打回。",
      "audio": "s08.wav",
      "raw_dur": 6.02,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 5.63,
      "dur_sec": 5.63,
      "cps": 5.33,
      "start_sec": 30.89,
      "end_sec": 36.52,
      "start_frame": 927,
      "end_frame": 1096
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "那怎么选？三个动作。",
      "audio": "s09.wav",
      "raw_dur": 2.1,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 1.69,
      "dur_sec": 1.69,
      "cps": 5.92,
      "start_sec": 36.6,
      "end_sec": 38.29,
      "start_frame": 1098,
      "end_frame": 1149
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "第一步，把范围收窄到具体场景、具体对象、具体功能。",
      "audio": "s10.wav",
      "raw_dur": 5.36,
      "speech_start": 0.22,
      "speech_end": 4.95,
      "dur_sec": 4.73,
      "cps": 5.29,
      "start_sec": 38.37,
      "end_sec": 43.1,
      "start_frame": 1151,
      "end_frame": 1293
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "第二步，选前先去知网搜一遍，文献和同类毕设都搜不到的题，别碰。",
      "audio": "s11.wav",
      "raw_dur": 5.36,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 5.13,
      "dur_sec": 5.13,
      "cps": 6.04,
      "start_sec": 43.18,
      "end_sec": 48.31,
      "start_frame": 1295,
      "end_frame": 1449
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "第三步，计算机的同学，优先选管理系统、小程序这类案例多的题，最容易完整落地。",
      "audio": "s12.wav",
      "raw_dur": 6.46,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 6.05,
      "dur_sec": 6.05,
      "cps": 6.28,
      "start_sec": 48.39,
      "end_sec": 54.44,
      "start_frame": 1452,
      "end_frame": 1633
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "记住，毕设是长跑：七分选题定生死，三分制作看功夫。",
      "audio": "s13.wav",
      "raw_dur": 5.22,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 4.81,
      "dur_sec": 4.81,
      "cps": 5.2,
      "start_sec": 54.52,
      "end_sec": 59.33,
      "start_frame": 1636,
      "end_frame": 1780
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "你现在是不知道选什么方向，还是有题目但怕做不出来？评论区告诉我。",
